      "0": {
        "content": "# utility29 HAProxy (PVE / OTLP front-end)\n\nPi **utility29** (172.16.1.29) \u2014 HAProxy fronts **pve.lindleyhome.com** (Proxmox) and **otel-gateway.lindleyhome.com** (:4317/:4318 \u2192 dt02/dt03).\n\n**Status:** \u26a0\ufe0f HAProxy-specific log file not yet in Grail. Ansible updated (`log-health-checks` + `/var/log/haproxy.log` + OTel include). **Re-run** `pve_frontend_haproxy.yml` and `otel-install_configure.yml` on utility29 to complete ingest.\n\nUntil then: OTLP heartbeat + content filters for any haproxy lines via syslog/journald.",
        "title": "",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      "1": {
        "davis": {
          "davisVisualization": {
            "isAvailable": true
          },
          "enabled": false
        },
        "query": "fetch logs\n| filter host.name == \"utility29\"\n| summarize lines = count()",
        "querySettings": {
          "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
          "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
          "enableSampling": false,
          "maxResultMegaBytes": 10,
          "maxResultRecords": 1000
        },
        "title": "OTLP lines (utility29)",
        "type": "data",
        "visualization": "singleValue",
        "visualizationSettings": {
          "singleValue": {
            "recordField": "lines"
          }
        }
      },
      "2": {
